// A mapping whose region entries sit beside an include: the shape question leaves the transform out of
// the population (two `{ AMI }` entries share `AMI`: a collection, no own-key refusal, no bound-map
// notice), while the selection below the `Mappings` section hands the transform to the predicate (it
